Z||000049||Jay||10-06-2000||09:16 PM||||I smoked a couple of big boys at the track.  I've got an 86 GT with a Northstar 300bhp and 295ftlbs of torque.  Camaros are usually no problem.  What I love is the older Hot Rodders who have their Novas and Mustangs.  Even if I don't beat them I get alot of compliments on my "sleeper"  I only race ot the track.  I find that going to the track makes me alot slower on the street.  I have no need to speed because I have the time sheets to prove how fast I am.  If someone wants to race on the street I don't do it.  It is more fun at the track and a whole lot safer, and I'm not an old fart, I'm 28!!!||||reg||1
